{"id":"comparison-modifiers","lv":"b1","n":31,"cat":"comparison","t":"Much better, a bit cheaper, the more… the better","en":"much / far / a bit + so sánh hơn · the more…, the more…","sum":"Nói hơn nhiều hay ít: much / far / a lot + so sánh hơn = hơn nhiều (much better, far more quickly); a bit / a little / slightly + so sánh hơn = hơn một chút (a bit cheaper); even + so sánh hơn = còn… hơn nữa. Không dùng very trước so sánh hơn (very better ✗). Ngày càng: so sánh hơn + and + so sánh hơn (bigger and bigger, more and more expensive). Càng… càng…: the + so sánh hơn…, the + so sánh hơn… (The more you practice, the better you get. The sooner, the better).","forms":[{"f":"much / far / a lot + so sánh hơn","vi":"much better · far cheaper"},{"f":"a bit / a little / slightly + so sánh hơn","vi":"a bit cheaper"},{"f":"so sánh hơn + and + so sánh hơn = ngày càng","vi":"bigger and bigger"},{"f":"the + so sánh hơn…, the + so sánh hơn… = càng… càng…","vi":"The more you practice, the better you get."}],"pts":[{"id":"comparison-modifiers","name":"much / far / a bit + comparative","vi":"Mức độ so sánh: much better, a bit cheaper"},{"id":"comparative-repetition","name":"the more…, the more / better and better","vi":"Càng… càng…; ngày càng…"}],"cast":{"nam":{"name":{"en":"Nam","vi":"Nam"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"shirt","top":"#4F7CC4","topShade":"#3F68A8","accent":"#3F68A8","hair":"fringe","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#EFC9A4","skinShade":"#DDB08A"},"x":560},"jay":{"name":{"en":"Jay","vi":"Jay"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"apron","top":"#2E2E2E","topShade":"#222222","accent":"#707070","hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#A86F4C","skinShade":"#93603F"},"x":1040}},"bg":"supermarket","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Which rice cooker should I buy?","vi":"Tôi nên mua nồi cơm điện nào?","ipa":["wɪtʃ","ɹaɪs","ˈkʊkɚ","ʃʊd","aɪ","baɪ"],"who":"nam","ann":{"expression":"thinking"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":2.146,"timing":[[0,0.476],[1,0.622],[2,0.974],[3,1.352],[4,1.5